/* ------------------------------- RELACIONES --------------------------------
- orders.accountId           → contacts.id
- orders.distributorId       → contacts.id (si colocación)
- interactions.accountId     → contacts.id
- events.accountId           → contacts.id (opcional)
- plv_material.accountId     → contacts.id
- accountPriceOverrides.accountId → contacts.id
- contacts.parentId          → contacts.id (PERSON→ORG)
- contacts.representativeOfIds[] → contacts.id (DISTRIBUIDOR→clientes)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

/* ---------------------------------- INDEXES --------------------------------
Firestore (sugeridos):
- contacts.roles array-contains
- contacts.nameNorm ASC, addresses.city
- contacts.externalRefs.holdedId (unique)
- contacts.externalRefs.gmaps.placeId (unique)
- contacts.customer.segment
- contacts.customer.placement
- contacts.employee.department
- contacts.parentId
- interactions.accountId + when
- orders.accountId + date
- orders.distributorId + date
- plv_material.accountId + status
- prices.accountPriceOverrides.accountId + sku
---------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

/* ---------------------------- REGLAS DE INFERENCIA -------------------------
Holded → Contact:
- type: "client"  → roles += CUSTOMER
- type: "supplier"→ roles += SUPPLIER
- status: "NEW"   → stage = POTENCIAL
- tags incluye "distribuidor" → customer.segment = DISTRIBUIDOR
- address fields → addresses[0] kind="billing"
- createdAt/updatedAt: normalizar a ISO; epoch segundos → *1000.

Google Maps dataset → Contact:
- roles += CUSTOMER
- customer.segment por heurística (restaurant/bar/pub/hotel→HORECA; supermarket/liquor→RETAIL; distributor/wholesale→DISTRIBUIDOR; sin dirección→ONLINE; else→UNKNOWN)
- placement = DIRECTA (hasta vincular distributorId)
- stage = LEAD, status = NEW (si permanentlyClosed → INACTIVE)
- geo, links.website/url/imageUrl/socials, metrics.rating/reviewsCount
- externalRefs.gmaps.placeId/cid/fid/kgmid
---------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

/* ----------------------------- DEDUPE / MERGE ------------------------------
Fuerza de coincidencia (desc):
1) externalRefs.gmaps.placeId
2) externalRefs.holdedId
3) phone normalizado (phones[].value)
4) links.website dominio + misma ciudad
5) nameNorm + ciudad (confirmación manual si duda)

Merge no destructivo:
- Nunca sobrescribir valor informado con null/""/undefined.
- roles/tags/socials: unión sin duplicados.
- customer.segment: si era UNKNOWN y llega [HORECA/RETAIL/DISTRIBUIDOR/ONLINE], actualizar.
- placement: solo cambia a COLOCACION cuando se asigna distributorId.
- metrics: si viene de GMaps y es consistente, actualizar rating/reviewsCount.
---------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

